@startuml kairos-add-edit-member-details-sequence
title Add or Edit Member

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open "Add Member" form
Admin -> WebAdmin: Fill form\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /members {data}
API -> DB: INSERT Member + (optional) User
DB --> API: New memberId
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created {memberId}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Edit existing member\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: PUT /members/{memberId} {changes}
API -> DB: UPDATE Member
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

WebAdmin --> Admin: Show success notification

@enduml
